1
00:00:01,139 --> 00:00:03,251
Bir zamonlar ajdodlarimiz

2
00:00:03,251 --> 00:00:06,661
ilm yoʻlida butun umrini bagʻishlagan.

3
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:11,833
Imom al-Buxoriy, Ibn Sino, al-Xorazmiy

4
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:13,566
kabi buyuk allomalar

5
00:00:13,566 --> 00:00:16,364
ilm bilan dunyoni oʻzgartirdi.

6
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:19,650
Ularning kuchi —

7
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,709
qiziquvchanlik, sabr, intizom

8
00:00:21,709 --> 00:00:24,347
va bilimga cheksiz muhabbat edi.

9
00:00:27,459 --> 00:00:29,575
Bugun esa koʻpchiligimiz

10
00:00:29,575 --> 00:00:32,772
vaqtimizni chalgʻituvchi narsalarga sarflaymiz.

11
00:00:32,772 --> 00:00:34,723
Oʻrganishni xohlaymiz,

12
00:00:34,723 --> 00:00:37,617
ammo nimadan boshlashni bilmaymiz.

13
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,462
Ammo bugun bilim olish uchun

14
00:00:40,462 --> 00:00:42,885
imkoniyatlar koʻproq.

15
00:00:42,885 --> 00:00:46,359
Toʻgʻri yoʻl, sifatli taʼlim va izchil harakat —

16
00:00:46,359 --> 00:00:48,685
oʻzgarishning boshlanishi.

17
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:52,190
Siz ham oʻz kelajagingizni yarating.

18
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:54,083
M.ACADEMYʼga obuna boʻling

19
00:00:54,083 --> 00:00:57,558
va ilmingizni keyingi bosqichga olib chiqing!
